[
  {
    "start": 0.0,
    "end": 21.62,
    "text": " Thanks for watching, please like and subscribe to help us spread Tipa's positive approach"
  },
  {
    "start": 21.62,
    "end": 23.36,
    "text": " message around the world."
  },
  {
    "start": 23.36,
    "end": 27.64,
    "text": " Hey guys, Beth Nolan here with Alejandro and Shelly."
  },
  {
    "start": 27.64,
    "end": 36.54,
    "text": " It's Friday, Friday, Friday, or Saturday for some people."
  },
  {
    "start": 36.54,
    "end": 45.980000000000004,
    "text": " So I love Shelly that intro your your pacing of the language is so much better than mine."
  },
  {
    "start": 45.980000000000004,
    "end": 46.980000000000004,
    "text": " It's a great reminder."
  },
  {
    "start": 46.980000000000004,
    "end": 50.400000000000006,
    "text": " Thank you to take it nice and slow, right?"
  },
  {
    "start": 50.400000000000006,
    "end": 51.400000000000006,
    "text": " Nice and slow."
  },
  {
    "start": 51.400000000000006,
    "end": 52.400000000000006,
    "text": " Absolutely."
  },
  {
    "start": 52.400000000000006,
    "end": 57.56,
    "text": " Well, you know, it's funny, I think about that, that idea of how my pacing affects my"
  },
  {
    "start": 57.56,
    "end": 62.6,
    "text": " interaction with so many people, whether they're living with just brain change associated"
  },
  {
    "start": 62.6,
    "end": 66.18,
    "text": " with the moment or stress, or whether they're living with brain changes, somebody who's"
  },
  {
    "start": 66.18,
    "end": 68.94,
    "text": " dealing with the disease based process."
  },
  {
    "start": 68.94,
    "end": 71.88,
    "text": " I'm curious, guys."
  },
  {
    "start": 71.88,
    "end": 77.56,
    "text": " What have you heard are some of the biggest challenging places in dementia when it comes"
  },
  {
    "start": 77.56,
    "end": 83.56,
    "text": " to family or even staff members, recognizing and living with this, this belief that we"
  },
  {
    "start": 83.56,
    "end": 87.46000000000001,
    "text": " know exists that the person I am still me, I'm just different."
  },
  {
    "start": 87.56,
    "end": 92.96000000000001,
    "text": " Where do you find that that really begins to break down?"
  },
  {
    "start": 92.96000000000001,
    "end": 102.16,
    "text": " I think when language use for the person living with dementia becomes a bigger hurdle, or"
  },
  {
    "start": 102.16,
    "end": 110.48,
    "text": " we get it less often and larger quantities that that it becomes, and I'm whenever I share"
  },
  {
    "start": 110.48,
    "end": 115.80000000000001,
    "text": " anything, by the way, it's usually me at the front of this line also becomes a little more"
  },
  {
    "start": 115.80000000000001,
    "end": 116.80000000000001,
    "text": " challenging."
  },
  {
    "start": 116.80000000000001,
    "end": 117.56,
    "text": " And I but I do think this one."
  },
  {
    "start": 117.56,
    "end": 125.04,
    "text": " Because we rely on it so much, you know, because most of our day is predicated on language"
  },
  {
    "start": 125.04,
    "end": 130.16,
    "text": " use for communication means this whole not this whole program, we show we do some visuals."
  },
  {
    "start": 130.16,
    "end": 132.34,
    "text": " But it's a big part of our day."
  },
  {
    "start": 132.34,
    "end": 138.62,
    "text": " So yeah, so I and I was gonna say it's that it's that realization that I can't have the"
  },
  {
    "start": 138.62,
    "end": 141.96,
    "text": " same kind of conversations that I used to have."
  },
  {
    "start": 141.96,
    "end": 143.34,
    "text": " Yeah, right."
  },
  {
    "start": 143.34,
    "end": 146.96,
    "text": " And you know, we always talked about X, Y, or Z, or we, you know, this one."
  },
  {
    "start": 146.96,
    "end": 147.46,
    "text": " Yeah."
  },
  {
    "start": 147.56,
    "end": 151.1,
    "text": " This was something we always did together."
  },
  {
    "start": 151.1,
    "end": 156.84,
    "text": " And it was a language kind of thing, or it was a pace, like it was something we did pretty"
  },
  {
    "start": 156.84,
    "end": 157.84,
    "text": " quickly."
  },
  {
    "start": 157.84,
    "end": 160.46,
    "text": " And now we can't do that."
  },
  {
    "start": 160.46,
    "end": 166.5,
    "text": " Well, so wherever it is for each individual, in terms of that care partner relationship,"
  },
  {
    "start": 166.5,
    "end": 169.78,
    "text": " language changes throughout the course of this entire journey."
  },
  {
    "start": 169.78,
    "end": 176.52,
    "text": " And for some people, it's when just the ability of my mom ability of my husband, my wife,"
  },
  {
    "start": 176.52,
    "end": 177.52,
    "text": " to problem solve."
  },
  {
    "start": 177.56,
    "end": 181.68,
    "text": " Or have the verbal abilities they used to, it could be as early as that, when there's"
  },
  {
    "start": 181.68,
    "end": 185.32,
    "text": " just a few word changes for somebody else, they're okay with that."
  },
  {
    "start": 185.32,
    "end": 188.34,
    "text": " But that is important to that care partner."
  },
  {
    "start": 188.34,
    "end": 191.94,
    "text": " And how do I move to that place where I'm able to see the person and see them just as"
  },
  {
    "start": 191.94,
    "end": 195.1,
    "text": " intelligently as I did before."
  },
  {
    "start": 195.1,
    "end": 196.48000000000002,
    "text": " But that's my identifier."
  },
  {
    "start": 196.48000000000002,
    "end": 200.94,
    "text": " But then for a lot of us, it sounds like it's much further along in the journey when language"
  },
  {
    "start": 200.94,
    "end": 207.54,
    "text": " is disappearing altogether, where I am really unable, things are stopping in terms of my"
  },
  {
    "start": 207.54,
    "end": 212.7,
    "text": " ability to see you as the human being I know you are."
  },
  {
    "start": 212.7,
    "end": 216.07999999999998,
    "text": " And I believe in my heart, I've seen this deepest stuff, I've even seen other people"
  },
  {
    "start": 216.07999999999998,
    "end": 219.94,
    "text": " stuff that talk about this, the person is still the person until the very end of their"
  },
  {
    "start": 219.94,
    "end": 220.94,
    "text": " life."
  },
  {
    "start": 220.94,
    "end": 221.94,
    "text": " How do I live that?"
  },
  {
    "start": 221.94,
    "end": 222.94,
    "text": " How do I be with it?"
  },
  {
    "start": 222.94,
    "end": 230.12,
    "text": " Well, you know, this, this family's journey of dementia, this, this thing we've talked"
  },
  {
    "start": 230.12,
    "end": 234.6,
    "text": " about, we talked about yesterday in terms of Emerald, that really becomes evident in"
  },
  {
    "start": 234.6,
    "end": 237.42,
    "text": " our Ruby segment, the segment where this Ruby."
  },
  {
    "start": 237.42000000000002,
    "end": 245.32000000000002,
    "text": " This amazing red, a strong color, strong in strengths and abilities, but skills are"
  },
  {
    "start": 245.32000000000002,
    "end": 246.32000000000002,
    "text": " what's changing."
  },
  {
    "start": 246.32000000000002,
    "end": 253.10000000000002,
    "text": " And that's why we also chose that red Ruby, because it's not just stopping skill, but"
  },
  {
    "start": 253.10000000000002,
    "end": 255.14000000000001,
    "text": " it's red for stopping."
  },
  {
    "start": 255.14000000000001,
    "end": 261.28000000000003,
    "text": " Do this guys, our ability to accurately assess anymore, whether or not I can do this."
  },
  {
    "start": 261.28000000000003,
    "end": 262.84000000000003,
    "text": " So many things are changing."
  },
  {
    "start": 262.84000000000003,
    "end": 265.58000000000004,
    "text": " And I think Shelly, you even touched a bit on that grief."
  },
  {
    "start": 265.58000000000004,
    "end": 266.58000000000004,
    "text": " It's."
  },
  {
    "start": 266.58,
    "end": 272.62,
    "text": " It's not just that I don't know how it's that I don't know if I can, and there's a"
  },
  {
    "start": 272.62,
    "end": 274.18,
    "text": " lot of things that I've got to let go."
  },
  {
    "start": 274.18,
    "end": 275.18,
    "text": " Yeah."
  },
  {
    "start": 275.18,
    "end": 276.18,
    "text": " So as a care partner, you're saying that."
  },
  {
    "start": 276.18,
    "end": 277.18,
    "text": " Yeah."
  },
  {
    "start": 277.18,
    "end": 278.18,
    "text": " Yeah."
  },
  {
    "start": 278.18,
    "end": 282.06,
    "text": " But I also, I also wonder about our rubies."
  },
  {
    "start": 282.06,
    "end": 289.53999999999996,
    "text": " What are they experiencing in the way of grief or are they, I mean, I'm maybe we'd have to"
  },
  {
    "start": 289.53999999999996,
    "end": 290.53999999999996,
    "text": " ask some."
  },
  {
    "start": 290.53999999999996,
    "end": 291.53999999999996,
    "text": " Yeah."
  },
  {
    "start": 291.53999999999996,
    "end": 295.47999999999996,
    "text": " If we still had language or some other way to communicate with us."
  },
  {
    "start": 295.47999999999996,
    "end": 296.47999999999996,
    "text": " Oh, truly."
  },
  {
    "start": 296.48,
    "end": 297.48,
    "text": " Yeah."
  },
  {
    "start": 297.48,
    "end": 298.48,
    "text": " And, and how do we see."
  },
  {
    "start": 298.48,
    "end": 299.48,
    "text": " How do we see it?"
  },
  {
    "start": 299.48,
    "end": 300.48,
    "text": " How do we, how do we."
  },
  {
    "start": 300.48,
    "end": 301.48,
    "text": " Yeah."
  },
  {
    "start": 301.48,
    "end": 302.48,
    "text": " How do we recognize that?"
  },
  {
    "start": 302.48,
    "end": 303.48,
    "text": " That, that, that."
  },
  {
    "start": 303.48,
    "end": 307.98,
    "text": " I'm going to take, I would take a guess, Shelly, that we would, people would communicate that"
  },
  {
    "start": 307.98,
    "end": 309.90000000000003,
    "text": " same idea of grief."
  },
  {
    "start": 309.90000000000003,
    "end": 314.42,
    "text": " Just having heard other, other people, core team members, people living with dementia"
  },
  {
    "start": 314.42,
    "end": 320.08000000000004,
    "text": " express like, I don't, these relationships have changed so much, even earlier on in the"
  },
  {
    "start": 320.08000000000004,
    "end": 323.08000000000004,
    "text": " disease that there is, there is a grief for them as well."
  },
  {
    "start": 323.08000000000004,
    "end": 324.08000000000004,
    "text": " Yeah."
  },
  {
    "start": 324.08000000000004,
    "end": 325.08000000000004,
    "text": " Okay."
  },
  {
    "start": 325.08,
    "end": 326.08,
    "text": " Yeah."
  },
  {
    "start": 326.08,
    "end": 327.08,
    "text": " That really came through Shelly."
  },
  {
    "start": 327.08,
    "end": 331.12,
    "text": " I, you know, through what you were talking about, that, that idea that if we know and"
  },
  {
    "start": 331.12,
    "end": 336.7,
    "text": " believe that a person is a person until the very end of their last breath, you know, those"
  },
  {
    "start": 336.7,
    "end": 337.91999999999996,
    "text": " feelings are still real."
  },
  {
    "start": 337.91999999999996,
    "end": 343.28,
    "text": " We know that in dementia, that part of the brain that, that I feel things, I know, not"
  },
  {
    "start": 343.28,
    "end": 348.74,
    "text": " just physical feelings and pain, but that is a misconception out there, um, that I am"
  },
  {
    "start": 348.74,
    "end": 353.08,
    "text": " unable to feel things at a certain point in this disease process, whether it's feelings,"
  },
  {
    "start": 353.08,
    "end": 354.08,
    "text": " emotions."
  },
  {
    "start": 354.08,
    "end": 357.74,
    "text": " I can figure out that you're acting differently to me."
  },
  {
    "start": 357.74,
    "end": 359.68,
    "text": " That happens with our professionals as well as family."
  },
  {
    "start": 359.68,
    "end": 363.03999999999996,
    "text": " It just really comes home with a family member, doesn't it?"
  },
  {
    "start": 363.03999999999996,
    "end": 364.03999999999996,
    "text": " Let's take a look at that scenario."
  },
  {
    "start": 364.03999999999996,
    "end": 369.12,
    "text": " And I've got a situation where it's just eating, just trying to get a task done, but noticing"
  },
  {
    "start": 369.12,
    "end": 373.32,
    "text": " if we will starting off with what we almost think of as the way things we know can go"
  },
  {
    "start": 373.32,
    "end": 374.76,
    "text": " the way things are."
  },
  {
    "start": 374.76,
    "end": 378.96,
    "text": " And we've got a relatively skilled and trained individual, Dorothy, trying to interact and"
  },
  {
    "start": 378.96,
    "end": 383.08,
    "text": " trying to get TIPA to eat something that we know she likes chocolate muffin."
  },
  {
    "start": 383.08,
    "end": 384.08,
    "text": " Ah."
  },
  {
    "start": 384.08,
    "end": 385.08,
    "text": " Sweet."
  },
  {
    "start": 385.08,
    "end": 386.18,
    "text": " It's good."
  },
  {
    "start": 386.18,
    "end": 391.0,
    "text": " And also maybe as a muffin form of that chocolate, maybe even Dorothy's getting some of her needs"
  },
  {
    "start": 391.0,
    "end": 393.91999999999996,
    "text": " that I feel like I'm getting some nutrition into her."
  },
  {
    "start": 393.91999999999996,
    "end": 397.38,
    "text": " Seems like a win-win good idea."
  },
  {
    "start": 397.38,
    "end": 402.86,
    "text": " Let's see how it goes, because I'm thinking without a lot of pack skill at this point"
  },
  {
    "start": 402.86,
    "end": 407.88,
    "text": " of the disease process, things are going to be maybe a little bit tough."
  },
  {
    "start": 407.88,
    "end": 414.03999999999996,
    "text": " So let's take a look at Dorothy and TIPA in this moment and see what happens."
  },
  {
    "start": 414.08,
    "end": 415.08,
    "text": " No."
  },
  {
    "start": 415.08,
    "end": 416.08,
    "text": " No."
  },
  {
    "start": 416.08,
    "end": 417.08,
    "text": " Chocolate muffin."
  },
  {
    "start": 417.08,
    "end": 418.08,
    "text": " I love a muffin."
  },
  {
    "start": 418.08,
    "end": 419.08,
    "text": " Muffin."
  },
  {
    "start": 419.08,
    "end": 420.08,
    "text": " Yeah."
  },
  {
    "start": 420.08,
    "end": 421.08,
    "text": " It's for you to eat."
  },
  {
    "start": 421.08,
    "end": 422.08,
    "text": " Here you go."
  },
  {
    "start": 422.08,
    "end": 423.08,
    "text": " No, not me."
  },
  {
    "start": 423.08,
    "end": 424.08,
    "text": " You."
  },
  {
    "start": 424.08,
    "end": 425.08,
    "text": " You."
  },
  {
    "start": 425.08,
    "end": 426.08,
    "text": " You."
  },
  {
    "start": 426.08,
    "end": 427.08,
    "text": " You."
  },
  {
    "start": 427.08,
    "end": 428.08,
    "text": " You."
  },
  {
    "start": 428.08,
    "end": 429.08,
    "text": " I want you to eat it."
  },
  {
    "start": 429.08,
    "end": 430.08,
    "text": " No."
  },
  {
    "start": 430.08,
    "end": 431.08,
    "text": " You."
  },
  {
    "start": 431.08,
    "end": 432.08,
    "text": " Put it here."
  },
  {
    "start": 432.08,
    "end": 433.08,
    "text": " Ah."
  },
  {
    "start": 433.08,
    "end": 434.08,
    "text": " Oh, not the paper."
  },
  {
    "start": 434.08,
    "end": 435.08,
    "text": " Oh, my God."
  },
  {
    "start": 435.08,
    "end": 436.08,
    "text": " TIPA."
  },
  {
    "start": 436.08,
    "end": 437.08,
    "text": " TIPA, no."
  },
  {
    "start": 437.08,
    "end": 438.08,
    "text": " Oh, jeez."
  },
  {
    "start": 438.08,
    "end": 439.08,
    "text": " Give me that."
  },
  {
    "start": 439.08,
    "end": 440.08,
    "text": " Give me that."
  },
  {
    "start": 440.08,
    "end": 441.08,
    "text": " TIPA."
  },
