    "text": " Oh, pause right there."
  },
  {
    "start": 453.08,
    "end": 460.08,
    "text": " Tell me, who were you guys watching?"
  },
  {
    "start": 460.08,
    "end": 463.53999999999996,
    "text": " Were you guys more watching Dorothy or were you watching TIPA?"
  },
  {
    "start": 463.53999999999996,
    "end": 468.0,
    "text": " Where did your, where were you drawn to?"
  },
  {
    "start": 468.0,
    "end": 472.68,
    "text": " I was more watching Dorothy, but I couldn't help but also be like."
  },
  {
    "start": 472.68,
    "end": 472.88,
    "text": " I was watching Dorothy."
  },
  {
    "start": 473.08,
    "end": 474.08,
    "text": " I was watching TIPA."
  },
  {
    "start": 474.08,
    "end": 475.08,
    "text": " Interesting."
  },
  {
    "start": 475.08,
    "end": 476.08,
    "text": " And I could."
  },
  {
    "start": 476.08,
    "end": 477.08,
    "text": " Okay, so what did you see, Alejandro?"
  },
  {
    "start": 477.08,
    "end": 484.65999999999997,
    "text": " Well, I was watching Dorothy, like, she seemed like she was the flash, almost like it was,"
  },
  {
    "start": 484.65999999999997,
    "end": 490.08,
    "text": " she seemed like she was moving so quickly at times in that segment, and it seemed so"
  },
  {
    "start": 490.08,
    "end": 495.08,
    "text": " hurried, but then I also could not help but hear some of the groans and like, from the"
  },
  {
    "start": 495.08,
    "end": 499.59999999999997,
    "text": " audience that I was like, I've never noticed that before, but they, they kind of are like"
  },
  {
    "start": 499.59999999999997,
    "end": 501.47999999999996,
    "text": " almost like, oh, my God, what's going to happen?"
  },
  {
    "start": 501.47999999999996,
    "end": 502.68,
    "text": " We know something's going to happen."
  },
  {
    "start": 502.68,
    "end": 507.68,
    "text": " Because it's that third person point of view that we have that Dorothy absolutely in this"
  },
  {
    "start": 507.68,
    "end": 508.68,
    "text": " moment does not."
  },
  {
    "start": 508.68,
    "end": 512.6800000000001,
    "text": " And it's, it's, that's one of the huge benefits of watching, right?"
  },
  {
    "start": 512.6800000000001,
    "end": 513.6800000000001,
    "text": " Is like, I can see."
  },
  {
    "start": 513.6800000000001,
    "end": 514.6800000000001,
    "text": " Yeah."
  },
  {
    "start": 514.6800000000001,
    "end": 517.6800000000001,
    "text": " We get to that place where we can actually see."
  },
  {
    "start": 517.6800000000001,
    "end": 521.6800000000001,
