  {
    "start": 881.44,
    "end": 884.44,
    "text": " The biggest thing."
  },
  {
    "start": 884.44,
    "end": 889.44,
    "text": " That supportive stance, working together with the person and being with them instead of"
  },
  {
    "start": 889.44,
    "end": 890.44,
    "text": " hovering over."
  },
  {
    "start": 890.44,
    "end": 891.44,
    "text": " Oh, yeah."
  },
  {
    "start": 891.44,
    "end": 896.34,
    "text": " And Brenda's really breaking this down in the true skills that she's looking at."
  },
  {
    "start": 896.34,
    "end": 899.44,
    "text": " She's able to pick this video apart and see it at a very different level."
  },
  {
    "start": 899.44,
    "end": 903.44,
    "text": " If it's the Brenda I'm thinking of, or maybe it's just some other skill, Brenda."
  },
  {
    "start": 903.44,
    "end": 904.44,
    "text": " Mm-hmm."
  },
  {
    "start": 904.44,
    "end": 905.44,
    "text": " Brenda's got a lot..."
  },
  {
    "start": 905.44,
    "end": 910.44,
    "text": " There are some Brendas out there, I don't know if it is, that can see this with a lot of"
  },
  {
    "start": 910.44,
    "end": 912.44,
    "text": " years of experience behind her."
  },
  {
    "start": 912.44,
    "end": 913.44,
    "text": " Mm-hmm."
  },
  {
    "start": 913.44,
    "end": 918.0200000000001,
    "text": " The also piece here, maybe all the takeaway is, maybe this is the first thing you're ever"
  },
  {
    "start": 918.0200000000001,
    "end": 920.84,
    "text": " seeing of Teeppa Snow, and someone just introduced you to this."
  },
  {
    "start": 920.84,
    "end": 925.94,
    "text": " Looking at this video, one of the things that I really noticed was at the end, that even"
  },
  {
    "start": 925.94,
    "end": 931.3000000000001,
    "text": " in this COVID world, where you've got a care partner and a person living with dementia,"
  },
  {
    "start": 931.3000000000001,
    "end": 936.4200000000001,
    "text": " and knowing what has to happen in that moment, and recognizing people have probably looked"
  },
  {
    "start": 936.4200000000001,
    "end": 939.44,
    "text": " at the fact that, is Dorothy testing on a weekly basis?"
  },
  {
    "start": 939.44,
    "end": 940.44,
    "text": " Is she doing the right thing?"
  },
  {
    "start": 940.44,
    "end": 942.44,
    "text": " Is she doing a rapid test, maybe on a daily basis?"
  },
  {
    "start": 942.44,
    "end": 943.44,
    "text": " Mm-hmm."
  },
  {
    "start": 943.44,
    "end": 947.44,
    "text": " Is, for the best of our ability, infection control handled here?"
  },
  {
    "start": 947.44,
    "end": 953.5,
    "text": " And I'm just really curious if maybe, as Teeppa then says, later on, when the lights"
  },
  {
    "start": 953.5,
    "end": 958.82,
    "text": " go down, she comes to the front of the stage, and then she talks about what happened with"
  },
  {
    "start": 958.82,
    "end": 962.3800000000001,
    "text": " the audience, breaks it down from her point of view, from Dorothy's point of view, after"
  },
  {
    "start": 962.3800000000001,
    "end": 967.82,
    "text": " every single one of these GEM states changes, talks and processes to figure out what's going"
  },
  {
    "start": 967.82,
    "end": 969.44,
    "text": " on, the same way we've kind of been here."
  },
  {
    "start": 969.44,
    "end": 970.44,
    "text": " Mm-hmm."
  },
  {
    "start": 970.44,
    "end": 973.94,
    "text": " She does that in the video, and has a moment where you can learn a little bit and figure"
  },
  {
    "start": 973.94,
    "end": 976.7,
    "text": " out what's going on, and you get some of those questions answered."
  },
  {
    "start": 976.7,
    "end": 982.0600000000001,
    "text": " And the one thing she comes away with is, you know, maybe sometimes it's okay to just"
  },
  {
    "start": 982.0600000000001,
    "end": 983.0600000000001,
    "text": " eat the chocolate."
  },
  {
    "start": 983.0600000000001,
    "end": 984.0600000000001,
    "text": " Yeah."
  },
  {
    "start": 984.0600000000001,
    "end": 985.0600000000001,
    "text": " And that's what we're taking away."
  },
  {
    "start": 985.0600000000001,
    "end": 986.0600000000001,
    "text": " Yeah."
  },
  {
    "start": 986.0600000000001,
    "end": 989.86,
    "text": " I was going to say, Christine also mentioned that the relationship is very different in"
  },
  {
    "start": 989.86,
    "end": 993.1,
    "text": " the second vignette than it was in the first one."
  },
  {
    "start": 993.1,
    "end": 997.98,
    "text": " And I think that goes right back to everything we talk about at PAC, is that relationship"
  },
  {
    "start": 997.98,
    "end": 999.44,
    "text": " is the first thing."
  },
  {
    "start": 999.44,
    "end": 1000.44,
    "text": " Right."
  },
  {
    "start": 1000.44,
    "end": 1004.8000000000001,
    "text": " Well, maybe with this one, maybe with this video, we can start to operationalize, break"
  },
  {
    "start": 1004.8000000000001,
    "end": 1009.96,
    "text": " down how I can make that relationship stay when all the other ways that I thought in"
  },
  {
    "start": 1009.96,
    "end": 1014.0600000000001,
    "text": " the past that relationship existed are changing."
  },
  {
    "start": 1014.0600000000001,
    "end": 1015.0600000000001,
    "text": " Yeah."
  },
  {
    "start": 1015.0600000000001,
    "end": 1019.5600000000001,
    "text": " So we hope that you all find those little bits of chocolate that you may just decide"
  },
  {
    "start": 1019.5600000000001,
    "end": 1024.1000000000001,
    "text": " to take a bite of this weekend, and maybe even check out these videos."
  },
  {
    "start": 1024.1000000000001,
    "end": 1029.24,
    "text": " Or at the very least, all you're at at this moment is able to join us in Live at Five."
  },
  {
    "start": 1029.24,
    "end": 1034.6200000000001,
    "text": " We will be back next week with a few more bits and morsels, if I will, of taking this,"
  },
  {
    "start": 1034.6200000000001,
    "end": 1038.6,
    "text": " seeing what's possible, and seeing how you too might be able to grow your skill to find"
  },
  {
    "start": 1038.6,
    "end": 1044.86,
    "text": " that relationship for every single one of our stuff."
  },
  {
    "start": 1044.8600000000001,
    "end": 1052.2600000000002,
    "text": " Have a great day, and thanks for watching."
